    "groundingSupports": [
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 60,
       "endIndex": 216,
       "text": "You are in a strong negotiating position: you are happy at Meta, were passively recruited, and hold an equivalent Senior/Staff-level role (IC6 $\\approx$ L6)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 220,
       "endIndex": 321,
       "text": "Google\u2019s initial offer is **solid, but it is an opening bid with substantial room for improvement**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 909,
       "endIndex": 970,
       "text": "| **Sign-on Bonus** | N/A | $0 | **$0** (typical first offer)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1172,
       "endIndex": 1345,
       "text": "Unlike Meta\u2019s quarterly even vest (25% per year), Google typically front-loads new-hire equity grants (historically **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** or **38% / 32% / 20% / 10%**)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1349,
       "endIndex": 1430,
       "text": "**Year 1 Total Comp:** ~$638,000 to ~$692,000 (due to 33\u201338% vesting in Year 1)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1434,
       "endIndex": 1536,
       "text": "**Year 4 Total Comp:** Drops sharply to ~$390,000\u2013$410,000 without stock growth and heavy refreshers"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1580,
       "endIndex": 1669,
       "text": "The recruiter is correct that Google equity refreshers vest over multiple years and stack"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       4,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1671,
       "endIndex": 1773,
       "text": "However, **Meta does the exact same thing**, often with more predictable and generous equity refreshes"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1775,
       "endIndex": 1872,
       "text": "You cannot rely on hypothetical future refreshers to bridge the compensation gap in Years 3 and 4"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2177,
       "endIndex": 2220,
       "text": "Target the upper quartile of the L6 PM band"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2226,
       "endIndex": 2273,
       "text": "**Sign-on Bonus: Ask for $75,000 \u2013 $100,000**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2393,
       "endIndex": 2449,
       "text": "Google routinely uses sign-on bonuses to bridge this gap"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2454,
       "endIndex": 2524,
       "text": "**Equity (GSUs): Counter with $1,250,000 \u2013 $1,300,000 over 4 years**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2543,
       "endIndex": 2648,
       "text": "$1.08M is standard for an initial offer, but L6 PM equity can reach $1.2M\u2013$1.35M+ for competitive hires"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3845,
       "endIndex": 3977,
       "text": "**Do not walk away**; Google expects you to negotiate, and they have significant budget headroom at L6 for base, equity, and sign-on"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3981,
       "endIndex": 4156,
       "text": "If they meet you halfway (e.g., $245k\u2013$250k base, $1.2M equity, and a $50k\u2013$60k sign-on), you will have secured an extra **~$150k\u2013$200k in total value** over your tenure"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
